      "name": "Children of the Night",
      "type": "specialAbility",
      "img": "systems/modern20/assets/icons/lorc/magic-swirl.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>Vampires command the lesser creatures of the world and, once per day, can call forth a pack of 4d8 rats, a swarm of 10d10 bats, or a pack of 3d6 wolves as a full-round action. These creatures arrive in 2d6 rounds and serve the vampire for up to 1 hour.</p>",
