      "name": "Damage Reduction 15/+1",
      "type": "specialAbility",
      "img": "systems/modern20/assets/icons/lorc/shield-reflect.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>In campaigns without magic weapons, the GM can disregard the vampire’s damage reduction, change it to 15/silver or 15/wood, or apply the damage reduction only to certain types of weapons (ballistic, bludgeoning, piercing, slashing, or sonic/concussion).</p>",
